4. Resource eligibility and classification
Not everything advertised as free is actually free. FreeStack must distinguish resource types clearly.
Type	Meaning
Completely free	No payment required for normal use
Free tier	Limited features or usage at no cost
Free credits	A limited credit balance
Student exclusive	Requires student verification
Open source	Source code is publicly available under a license
Free learning material	Educational content accessible without payment
Free trial	Temporary access that may require payment details

A free trial must never be presented as a permanent free tier.

FreeStack may include freemium products, but must clearly explain what is free and what requires payment.
