8. Trust and verification policy
FreeStack's value depends on reliable information.

Verification statuses:
- Verified
- Needs review
- Expired
- Unavailable
- Unverified
Verification rules:
- Prefer official provider documentation and pricing pages.
- Store source URLs for important claims.
- Preserve evidence for pricing, limits and eligibility.
- Do not mark an offer verified merely because an AI model extracted it.
- Require human review for important changes.
- Keep the last verified data if a fetch fails.
- Record changes to free-tier limits over time.
